# fixture: warp room → town (out of the house door), map-local vars, and back in through the door.
# Timings (real World/VM, 30 Hz): a map load fades in over 8 ticks; walk 8 ticks per tile; a tap on a
# new direction only turns (2 ticks); text prints 1 char per 2 ticks.
#
# new game: spawn in the room; the onFrame intro starts once the fade-in ends
0 assert map fixture:ROOM
0 assert position fixture:ROOM 14 16
0 assert flag fixture:FLAG_NEW_GAME_DONE true
8 assert message closed
12 assert message open
80 press a
82 release a
86 assert message closed
86 assert var fixture:VAR_ROOM_INTRO 1
# right onto 15,16 (turn, then one step), then down to the exit mat at 15,19
90 press right
94 release right
110 assert position fixture:ROOM 15 16
110 press down
130 release down
150 assert position fixture:ROOM 15 19
# pushing down into the exit (a blocked warp tile below the mat) warps to the town: fade out 150..157, load at 157
150 press down
152 release down
170 assert map fixture:TOWN
170 assert var fixture:VAR_OBJ_GFX_ID_0 3
170 assert var fixture:VAR_MAP_LOCAL_0 1
# arriving on the town door (10,13): hidden while the door opens (8 ticks) under the fade in, then the
# player walks out south (165..172) and the door closes (173..180); free from 181
170 assert position fixture:TOWN 10 14
185 assert position fixture:TOWN 10 14
185 assert facing player down
# push north into the door: turn (190, 191), the door opens (192..199), the player walks in (200..207),
# the door closes (208..215), fade out (216..224, load at 224)
190 press up
194 release up
220 assert map fixture:TOWN
# back in the room on the blocked warp tile, the player walks one step out onto the mat
250 assert map fixture:ROOM
250 assert position fixture:ROOM 15 19
250 assert var fixture:VAR_MAP_LOCAL_0 0
250 assert var fixture:VAR_ROOM_INTRO 1
260 assert message closed
